				<wikidot:authorName>Subject90</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2905264</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Shorter instances of SCP-031-J-1 show a tendency to place various adult humans in a trance state. Subjects act with a spirit of benevolence towards instances, and will fiercely defend instances in case of attack.</p> <p>Oh god all I can imagine is an agent trying to capture a kid and the mother beating them in the head with a purse.<br /> &quot;Ma'am, your in a trance, this is not your kid. Please, stop hitting me.&quot;<br /> +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
